# Rust Protocol Proof

Command:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol app_game -- --nocapture
```

Result:

```text
test result: ok. 12 passed; 0 failed
```

Coverage:

- `AppGameServiceReadModel` serializes app/game journal projection metadata:
  schema version, generated timestamp, limit, custody label, replay state,
  capability status, returned counts, inventory rows, running-now rows,
  foreground-now rows, launcher rows, and daily rollups.

Command:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol activity_surface -- --nocapture
```

Result:

```text
test result: ok. 9 passed; 0 failed
```

Coverage:

- `ActivityAppUseReadModelRow` serializes typed app/game projection state into
  the activity-surface service contract.
- `ActivityGamesReadModelRow` serializes launcher/session source counts and
  explicit product/classification/capability state.
- Field names match the TypeScript contract camelCase payloads.
